A stylized logo featuring a bold, modern 2048 game icon. The background is a deep navy blue gradient that fades from dark at the top to lighter at the bottom. In the center, a large white number "2048" is displayed in a clean, sans‑serif font, with a subtle drop shadow to give depth. The digits are slightly rounded and have a faint glow that suggests motion. Below the number, a small, stylized arrow icon points to the right, hinting at the sliding mechanic of the game. The overall composition is balanced, with the text centered and the arrow subtly offset to the right, creating a dynamic feel that conveys speed and strategy.
